🚀 Agentic Sales CRM: The Fact-Bank Engine
This system is a high-performance Automated Setter designed for trade businesses (Solar, Boreholes, etc.). Unlike standard chatbots, this is an Agentic Engine that uses a single "Decision Brain" to mine facts, update a Source of Truth (SSOT), and move leads through a sales pipeline based on business rules.
🏗️ Technical Stack
Frontend: Next.js (App Router), Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons.
Backend: Node.js, whatsapp-web.js (Stable Mode).
Database: Supabase (PostgreSQL) with Realtime enabled.
AI Brain: OpenAI GPT-4o (Structured JSON Output).
🧠 Core Philosophy: The Fact-Bank CRM
The CRM is the Single Source of Truth (SSOT).
The CRM never "thinks": It only stores verified facts (Employees, CRM used, Meeting time).
The AI is a Miner: Every message is an opportunity to extract a new fact and lock it into the CRM.
Sequence Locking: The AI follows a strict sales protocol: Secure Demo Time FIRST 
→
→
 Record Fact in CRM 
→
→
 Drop Dog Groomer Success Video SECOND.
📂 System Structure
1. The Dashboard (/)
The high-level overview of the entire business.
Total Prospects: Aggregate count of every lead ever contacted.
AI Agents Active: Count of leads currently being handled by the Decision Engine.
Purpose: Provides the "Bird's Eye View" of lead volume and system health.
2. The Action Pipeline (/pipeline)
The central command center. Replicated exactly from the high-end demo.
Needs Immediate Action (Red Banner): Automatically displays the top 4 "Hot Leads" (Lead Score > 90). Clicking a name opens their modal instantly.
Stats Boxes: Real-time counters for AI Handling, Qualified Leads, and Demo Goal.
The Kanban Board: 6 Columns (Outreach Sent, Replied, AI Qualifying, Interested / Demo, Booked / Won, Lost / Ghosted).
Real-time Movement: Cards slide between columns automatically as the Backend updates the status field in Supabase.
3. The Lead Intelligence Modal (Split View)
When a card is clicked, this "Intelligence Center" opens. It is split into two distinct zones:
Left: Intelligence Panel (The SSOT):
Displays locked data: Industry, Region, and Follower Stats.
Shows the Fact Memory: A dedicated section for "Mined Facts" (CRM, budget, staff size).
Send Demo Video Button: A primary action button for the human agent.
Right: Conversation History:
A real-time WhatsApp thread showing every back-and-forth.
Blue bubbles = You/Bot, White bubbles = Lead.
Manual Override: An input box at the bottom allows a human to type a message, which is logged to the SSOT.
⚙️ Backend Services (The Decision Engine)
The backend is refactored into modular services to ensure stability and "Smart" behavior:
decisionService.js (The Brain)
Performs One AI Call that returns a massive JSON object including:
reply: The high-energy, short sales message.
intent: The detected goal (e.g., BOOKING_CONFIRMED).
new_facts: New data discovered for the SSOT memory.
video_trigger: A boolean that tells the system when to drop the Dog Groomer link.
knowledgeService.js (The Bible)
The only place where product facts exist. It stores:
The Dog Groomer Video link.
Pricing and Feature lists.
Strict rules for the "Time -> Video" sequence.
pipelineService.js (Business Rules)
Maps the AI's detected Intent to the actual Kanban Columns. It uses a "Forward-Only" rule: a lead can move from "Replied" to "Interested," but it is blocked from moving backward to "Outreach Sent."
eventService.js (The Audit Trail)
Every time the AI makes a decision, it logs an entry into the events table. This allows you to see why a lead moved or why the AI thought an objection was raised.